1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,660
We are only here because of her.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:14,580
In a small town in southern Ethiopia,
school ended after fifth grade.

3
00:00:15,117 --> 00:00:23,487
At sixteen, Emaye chose to go to a land
she didn't know, to keep learning.

4
00:00:24,908 --> 00:00:31,608
She left everything she knew, and walked.
Alone.

5
00:00:35,117 --> 00:00:42,897
Addis Ababa was enormous,
and she knew no one.

6
00:00:43,408 --> 00:00:50,308
Every evening, helped by a kuraz's light,
she studied so she wouldn't fall behind.

7
00:00:50,825 --> 00:00:55,482
In her classroom, she was often
the only woman.

8
00:00:56,413 --> 00:01:01,205
She finished middle school
and began high school.

9
00:01:01,742 --> 00:01:09,332
And she taught her children
that learning is worth any road.

10
00:01:09,867 --> 00:01:16,275
Every lamp we light today
was lit from hers.

11
00:01:17,323 --> 00:01:19,543
An educated person may fall,
but never falls for good.

12
00:01:20,947 --> 00:01:23,657
Thank you, Emaye.
